{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Mythic Trials 2",
    "steam_appid": 3565670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLO OR MULTIPLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>alone or with friends</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players in <strong>Co-op PvE</strong> or <strong>PvP</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A daily <strong>World Boss</strong> with a global ranking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very challenging <strong>Draft Mode</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of different skills </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer market to sell your loot </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY CHARACTER IS UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't copy another's build; you must choose between random skill combinations, and each character has different options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize each skill with unique and random mods to try to create the best possible combination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME STRONGER WITH EVERY RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay endlessly with ever stronger abilities, items, and enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAISE PETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find and raise pets that will help you in battle! The higher their level and tier, the stronger they will be </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will inherit their parents' skills and discover new ones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IT'S A COMPETITIVE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is designed to push you to give your best, even when playing solo! All game modes have global rankings!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLO OR MULTIPLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>alone or with friends</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players in <strong>Co-op PvE</strong> or <strong>PvP</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A daily <strong>World Boss</strong> with a global ranking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very challenging <strong>Draft Mode</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of different skills </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer market to sell your loot </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY CHARACTER IS UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't copy another's build; you must choose between random skill combinations, and each character has different options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize each skill with unique and random mods to try to create the best possible combination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME STRONGER WITH EVERY RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay endlessly with ever stronger abilities, items, and enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAISE PETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find and raise pets that will help you in battle! The higher their level and tier, the stronger they will be </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will inherit their parents' skills and discover new ones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IT'S A COMPETITIVE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is designed to push you to give your best, even when playing solo! All game modes have global rankings!</p>",
    "short_description": "Mythic Trials 2 is a Hack'n'Slash Rogue-Lite where each player has different skills. PvP Battle Royale, PvE Cooperation modes, Diablo-style loot, pet breeding, world bosses, rankings, drafts, and much more.",
